# virtual environment
.venv/
venv/

# python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The generated artifacts (data/processed_train.csv, data/processed_test.csv,
# churn_model.pkl) are deliberately TRACKED, not ignored. They are the pipeline's
# deliverables, and committing them lets a reviewer reproduce the reported test
# score without a 21-minute re-run. Re-adding ignore rules for them would hide
# exactly the output the project exists to produce.
#
# The processed CSVs are byte-for-byte reproducible from DataProcessing.py, but
# churn_model.pkl is NOT portable: it is bound to the interpreter and library
# versions recorded in model_report.md, and will not load elsewhere.
*.joblib
